WEBVTT

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.010
If I had to give it a name, I'd say it's some sort of "half-sleep".

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:26.330
Although it's displayed in the game, the data is missing.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:30.340
Someone on the other end probably removed it when you tried to help your friend.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.840
That's probably why your hand is numb.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.780
By the way, I heard there was a change in your friend's condition.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.850
Yes.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:44.640
Apparently she had a brief reaction on the eleventh.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.560
So she really did appear in Mac Anu.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:55.240
If the culprit is in a hurry, he will surely target this territorial fight too.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:01.790
But we can't just interrupt tens of thousands of people on this server because "something is suspicious".

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.620
The management, as usual.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:09.900
Even though it was so serious?

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.010
It was a local problem, and it didn't last long.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.560
Okay, don't log in until we can counter the enemy's abilities.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.010
That goes twice for you, Sakuya.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:23.520
We can't afford to lose you to the enemy.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.500
So please, be careful.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:40.780
The boy in the center of all this died seven years ago.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:40.800
And the culprit is looking for donors.
The boy in the center of all this died seven years ago.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.500
And the culprit is looking for donors.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.980
While turning The World's players into Sleepers, he looked for a fitting donor.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:51.020
An enemy!

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:56.510
But why would someone look for a donor for a dead kid?

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:04.780
I've been wondering... What if he doesn't know that that boy is dead?

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:05.850
What? That's silly!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.850
He's looking for a donor because he knows about his condition!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.860
There's no way he wouldn't know that he died seven years ago!

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.860
That's enough for today. Eat dinner, take a bath and go to sleep.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.790
A sphere?

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.850
Good job noticing that post.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.000
What do you think?

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.930
Is it the same as back then?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.780
I can't say for sure from just this...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.440
Here again?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.520
I died seven years ago, yet it still hurts.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.410
They suck so much at PK'ing.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:24.960
We really should have joined the fight, too. We could PK like, hundreds of them.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.810
Implying that's impressive here.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:31.110
Eh? You talkin' to me?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.060
And what if I am? Are you gonna PK me?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.820
Watch yourself!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.410
If you don't think I'll PK here, you've got another thing coming!

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:44.090
Says someone who wouldn't even join a war.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:47.610
Apparently I'm gonna have to kill you to shut you up.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.830
Kill me? You're a dumbass.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.330
I'll just PK...

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.340
What did you just do?

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:05.380
If you like to PK so much, I'll show you an experience as real as dying!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.940
No traces.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.720
Fog?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.590
It hurts!

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:41.190
That's overdoing it!

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.810
It hurts! It hurts so much!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.350
What's the hell?

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.260
Get ready!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:04:59.570
Shit!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.860
That's...

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.080
Pick up, Iori!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.880
So it's begun?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.120
He did it.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.320
Your client is really something.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.960
Who asked you for that list?

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:40.210
I can't tell you! I have my poli-

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:44.650
Damn, what the-

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:49.160
Don't get the wrong impression. We're not playing a game.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.190
Why can't we log out?

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.470
Now is not the time to cry!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:58.300
Here they come!

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:00.800
Tobias!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:04.630
Hey, she's here! Eri's here!

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:05.750
Sakuya!

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:06.770
Incoming!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.180
Sakuya!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.730
I'm sorry! I didn't mean it, forgive me!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:26.310
Now! Everyone, run!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.410
Sakuya!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.870
Why did you come here?!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.660
You weren't picking up your phone!

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:45.570
The One?

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.180
Did the culprit do that too?

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.680
This is just too much.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.780
We should get going.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.360
Sakuya is waiting for us.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.020
What's that?!

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:23.270
It looks like he's not planning on solving this peacefully.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:27.610
If we don't destroy that, we can't log out.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.600
And what do you want to do? We don't even know where it is!

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:33.890
We'll draw him out.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:37.830
Look! He's brought quite a toy.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:41.370
If he can do that much, why is he being so indiscriminate?

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:50.560
If this childish rage is his true personality, he'll show himself for sure when we mess with his plans!

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.510
We're using the Admiral Cannon! Begin preparations immediately!

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:06.060
Hurry! Let us in, let us in!

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:08.120
To the leader!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.890
I can't analyze all the changed mnemonics.

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.990
Use the disassembler to change them again.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.340
Can you really use the Admiral Cannon?

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:24.630
If we can regain control of it.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.610
I said you can't!

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:27.540
We must see them!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.260
Idiot! Why are you here?!

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:36.550
But Eri is...

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.130
I told you to stay put! Why-

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.330
So that's how it is.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.140
I see.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:59.410
After seeing that ability earlier, I think your right hand might have access rights to the Pariah Folder.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:04.230
Try accessing it, okay? But don't delete anything!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:13.210
I'm rewriting data via Sakuya's FMD address.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.790
A gate?!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.490
I retrieved the data from the pariah folder.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:38.490
What? They stopped the war game already?

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.780
The last time is so boring.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.720
I wanted to play with Sakuya just once more...

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:59.420
Why is it... like this?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.520
Why can't we get going?

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.310
The teleporter's not working!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.260
Open the gates!

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:14.310
Move all the survivors to the Admiral Cannon!

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.880
What?

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.120
Then, did you stop it?

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.200
Would the usual player listen to others?

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:24.280
Nothing at stake, nothing to draw.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.040
Get moving already!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.980
Those who can move, get to the Chaos Gate!

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:32.620
Please help us handle this situation!

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:38.160
Okay, we should get going too.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.020
Let's go.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.720
Iori!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:44.720
A mail from Hermit!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:47.440
He says Eri is in Magnith!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:49.010
I must go!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:49.730
Stop her!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.730
Don't let her go alone!

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:52.950
Wait!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:54.230
Sorry!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.240
Why are you doing this?! I have to get to Eri!

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:02.850
Shut up!

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:05.850
Tobias will be there.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.050
Get it?

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:10.450
Even if you do find Eri, you can't do anything about it.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:16.060
To draw out the culprit, you should try to attack the Magnild's heart.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.250
He's probably given up on looking for donors.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:24.930
If you try to keep him from destroying himself along with The World, he's sure to try to stop you.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.670
Open a whisper channel.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:27.760
Change the encryption.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.080
Hurry.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.980
Iori, take me along too!

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.240
I'm going to Magnith.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:40.650
It'll all be fine. I'll find Eri for sure.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:42.160
Iori!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.400
Will it be all right?

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:49.990
Although their goal is different, the result will be the same.

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:52.720
We have to do all that we can!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:17.330
From the Chaos Gate, just go downwards. After a while, you'll get to the heart.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.400
Understood.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:24.970
All hands! Form six teams and prepare to fire the Admiral Cannon!

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.220
Start up the reactor! Quickly, get the cannon loaded!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.540
Hurry! Don't let up for even a second!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:49.310
Hey, hurry!

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:51.040
Thanks for telling me!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.400
I've entered closed space.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.890
You are close. Be careful.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.060
Roger.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:06.950
Is this it?

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.400
Iori?

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:14.910
This...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.080
What is it?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.190
Did something happen?

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.250
Hey!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.920
You can't do that

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.170
You can't destroy it yet. Sakuya is coming.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.070
So it was you?!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.760
She's been cut off?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.600
So they're after Sakuya?

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:44.270
An Alien Ward...?

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.450
Does Sakuya know about me too?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.140
Sakuya didn't doubt you for a second!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.790
Stop this and give back Eri!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:05.960
Thanks.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.390
That's all I wanted to hear.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:10.950
Wait, Hermit! What are you planning to do?!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:02.090
Eri?!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:02.790
What?

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.540
It's me!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.960
Hermit!

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:07.150
I'll guide you.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.490
Eri and the culprit are down there.

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:14.890
You could defeat the person that messed up The World!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.210
He's not an enemy!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.530
He was looking for donors for a sick boy!

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:25.970
He's not a bad person!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:28.630
But that boy has been dead for a long time...

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:35.340
I'm a suitable donor! So I have to tell him!

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:38.310
You're kidding.

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.390
Asumi!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.950
That was great!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.090
Eri!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:10.560
Asumi! Get away from Hermit! He's the puppet master!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.970
Nice job. This is the goal.

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:17.220
What's going on?

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.150
You heard it.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.430
I did it all.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.980
If you defeat me,

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.810
this quest will be cleared.

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.340
Defeat you? What do you mean!?

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:56.360
I'm the one who turned everyone into Sleepers. I'm the dead boy.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:18:00.470
But I didn't know I was dead until recently.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:05.610
I can't remember how long I've been here.

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.810
When I came to, I was in this body, holding this branch.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.090
With it, I am a god of this world.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:17.490
Or maybe a wizard.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:23.330
I thought it was God telling me to use this to cure my disease.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:28.790
I didn't think about what happened to all those people I used it on.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:33.370
It was scary. But there was no other way.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.000
Lock on to target.

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:39.330
The target is: the Quantum Prison in mid-air, above the Magnild!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:53.180
Sakuya, erase me and let it be all over!

00:18:53.180 --> 00:18:56.860
I don't want to! There must be some other way!

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:05.020
This is just a game for you, but it's real for me.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.030
If I get cut, it hurts. And I've experienced death more than enough.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:13.450
But it's never over. I'm forced to live on, without a future.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.640
It's a nightmare.

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:18.870
Let's end this.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:20.930
Admiral Cannon, fire!

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.190
I was happy.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.700
You were the only one who ever called me their friend.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:46.690
Can I have a final selfish request?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.610
Would you hug me?

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:06.260
Now I know why I was drawn to you.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:09.660
I've been looking for you all this time!

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:11.580
I'm sorry.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:38.730
The events of the Christmas territorial battles were forgotten in a matter of weeks.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:43.630
The World returned to how it was before,

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.760
but for a while, we didn't feel like logging in.

00:20:47.690 --> 00:20:50.750
Until we got that message from the leader.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.960
Huh? Anyone there?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.550
Ah, it got through?

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:58.200
I'm in a bit of a hurry, so let's get to it.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.990
It's about Hermit.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:01.330
He's alive.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:06.570
On his father's request, his body was put into hibernation.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.560
After a lot of legal paperwork.

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:11.370
Then, he was connected to the Quantum Prison.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:12.960
Quantum Prison?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:17.510
It's a prison for people's consciousness.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.960
It uses a technique called "Soul Digitalize".

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.570
Umm...

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:26.490
The digitalized brain is used as part of a quantum computer.

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:32.380
His brain had to be put into hibernation, but the research facility that saved him provided the equipment.

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.810
Huh? Then...

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.060
Don't worry.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:37.120
His body is still there.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:44.050
There was probably someone behind the scenes that made them use the Quantum Prison on him.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:47.070
It was no accident that you met Hermit!

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.480
Someone in the background...

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:49.990
Not God?

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.360
Whatever.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:54.500
Hey, be nice.

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:01.910
Let's talk about the rest later.

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:06.310
It's been so long since I came to this bath!

00:22:06.310 --> 00:22:08.190
I'm first!

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:09.930
What are you, a child?!

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:15.100
When I'm 18, I'm going to register as a donor.

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.340
And hope that someday I'll meet a healthy Hermit.

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:22.970
Yeah. Hermit's waiting too, I think.

00:22:22.970 --> 00:22:25.190
He loved you, Asumi!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:29.110
What's with that? You sound like you're his sister.

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:32.530
I spent a lot of time with him.

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:36.530
Then let's play in The World, the four of us together!

00:22:37.430 --> 00:22:40.360
You're not scared, after all that's happened?

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:45.170
Until Soul Digitalize completely disappears from The World,

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:47.830
it'll be used again in a different form.

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:53.550
But then, we have no other choice but to keep watching.

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:55.830
It's the world my brother loved so much.

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.420
I won't let them mess it up.

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:06.240
Don't throw that in the bath.

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:12.510
We'll meet again... someday.

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:31.800
With a feverish heat
Ukareta netsu no naka ni

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:37.040
Sleeping more in the day than ever before
Ikudo to sugiru hi no nemuri

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:46.950
When I woke up, what did I see to make my heart dance?
Mezameta toki ni mune wa nani wo mite odoru no ka

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:55.790
Where did I promise to return to?
Doko he modoru to yakusoku shita no?

00:23:55.790 --> 00:24:08.670
We can't return to the ever-repeating old memories
Kurikaeshita tooi kioku ni wa kaerenai

00:24:08.670 --> 00:24:16.290
Please, that moment of happiness
Negai yo, hitotoki no yorokobi ni

00:24:16.290 --> 00:24:19.120
Should last forever
Towa wo egaite

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:28.520
If those sunk in sorrow cried out that there's no help,
Sukui wa nai to shizumi yuku mono ga naita nara

00:24:28.520 --> 00:24:40.210
Remember the warmth that wasn't faked
Mayakasi ja nai nukumori wo omoidashite
